<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AURORA - Plantilla de Prueba</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #eef2ff 100%);
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        color: #1e293b;
      }

      .wrapper {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 32px 16px;
      }

      .card {
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-radius: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 26px 28px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
        color: #f8fafc;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .hero p {
        margin: 10px 0 0;
        opacity: 0.92;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 28px;
      }

      .content p {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .credentials {
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
        background: #f0f9ff;
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .credentials .label {
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #64748b;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }

      .credentials .value {
        margin-top: 4px;
        font-family: Consolas, Monaco, monospace;
        color: #0f172a;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      .status {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #fef9c3;
        color: #854d0e;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 18px 28px 26px;
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="hero">
          <h1>AURORA · Sistema Zero-Trust</h1>
          <p>Correo de prueba para validar renderizado de plantilla Handlebars.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
          <p>Hola, {{email}}.</p>
          <p>Este mensaje confirma que el motor de plantillas HTML está funcionando correctamente.</p>

          <div class="credentials">
            <div class="label">Usuario</div>
            <div class="value">{{email}}</div>
            <div class="label">Contraseña temporal</div>
            <div class="value">{{password}}</div>
          </div>

          <span class="status">Pendiente de validación por administrador</span>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
          Entorno de desarrollo · Mailpit · AURORA GSYA
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
